\f0\fs24 \cf0 # \uc0\u55356 \u57096  MindfulTrack - Mental Health Tracker\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56524  Overview\
MindfulTrack is a modern mental health tracking application that helps users monitor their emotional well-being, maintain journals, and gain insights into their mood patterns.\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55356 \u57263  Objectives\
- Promote mental wellness\
- Encourage self-reflection\
- Support Sustainable Development Goal 3 (Good Health and Well-being)\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56960  Features\
\
### \uc0\u55357 \u56842  Mood Tracking\
- Daily mood logging using emojis\
- Notes and tagging system\
\
### \uc0\u55357 \u56541  Journal\
- Personal journaling system\
- Save thoughts and experiences\
\
### \uc0\u55357 \u56522  Analytics\
- Mood frequency charts\
- Trend visualization\
\
### \uc0\u55358 \u56598  AI Suggestions\
- Smart insights based on mood history\
- Personalized mental health tips\
\
### \uc0\u55357 \u56592  Login System\
- Secure session-based login\
- User-specific data\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55356 \u57101  SDG Alignment\
This project supports:\
**SDG 3: Good Health and Well-being**\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u57056 \u65039  Tech Stack\
- Python\
- Streamlit\
- SQLite\
- Plotly\
